ade frenético. \r\nVeredicto: Muy recomendado si tienes un grupo de 3 amigos más.", "timestamp_created": 1777432466, "timestamp_updated": 1777432466, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224106425", "author": {"steamid": "76561199112796702", "personaname": "ADONAY", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199112796702/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 425, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 425, "last_played": 1777170178, "avatar": "9c65091fc13bac5d8e8039c9208e75862077e6c2"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "EXELTENTE JUEGO PARA JUAGAR EN SOLITARIO Y COPERATIVO TAMBIEN MUY BUENO QUE ESTA EN ESPAÑOL.", "timestamp_created": 1777170367, "timestamp_updated": 1777170367, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "hardware": {"system_ram": "16228", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8750H CPU @ 2.20GHz", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 with Max-Q Design", "vram_size": 8006}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224106258", "author": {"steamid": "76561199027799602", "personaname": "Epic Destro", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199027799602/", "num_games_owned": 60, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 1349, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1327, "last_played": 1777170577, "avatar": "eb5bc34580102be46515fd5e4dcde116bc5d3f1d"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "El juego es est